        "description": "Exhibition capsule at Russky Dom 2026, stand K62 (\"The Quiet Strength of Kamchatka. How nature becomes interior\"). The character of Kamchatka is told through light, matter, sound, scent, taste and touch, along a route of seven zones. Author of the capsule: Tokareva Design. Vargov®Design takes part with light (\"Light as a work of art\") in zone 02 «Лёд и туман» (\"Ice and Mist\"); the composition shown is LC0556: a school of manta rays rising out of a wave, its edges lit with points of warm light.",
